## Summary
Grafana has officially released gcx and MCP servers to facilitate the development of intelligent agents that leverage telemetry data for enhanced functionality and analytics. These servers are part of Grafana's efforts to support advanced observability and AI-driven applications.

## Key Points
- Grafana launched new servers named gcx and MCP.
- These servers are designed to assist in the development of intelligent agents.
- Intelligent agents are built using telemetry data for real-time insights.
- This release expands Grafana's offerings in the technology sector.


